Adapted portions (modified: inverted to recover the noise, or re-used inline):
  - jm2d_toy/models/denoiser.py, DenoiserMLP.get_noise: adapted from
    diffusers.schedulers.scheduling_ddpm.DDPMScheduler.add_noise (diffusers 0.31.0);
